[00:00.000] 作词 : 尚雯婕
[00:01.000] 作曲 : 尚雯婕
[00:12.110]编曲：Red Triangle
[00:16.740]Close my eyes (闭上双眼)
[00:18.100]Spread my wings (展开翅膀)
[00:19.690]Feel my heart beat (感受自己的心跳)
[00:21.290]In the lights (在光晕中)
[00:23.170]Never so alive (我从未如此鲜活)
[00:25.960]Ready to fly (亟待翱翔)
[00:29.660]Come with me (来)
[00:31.170]Dance with me (与我共舞)
[00:32.659]Glide with me (一起越过)
[00:34.220]Glide through the night (每一个夜晚)
[00:37.430]Let go of fear (放下恐惧吧)
[01:21.710]Close my eyes (闭上双眼)
[01:22.880]Spread my wings (展开翅膀)
[01:24.560]Feel my heart beat (感受自己的心跳)
[01:26.210]In the lights (在光晕中)
[01:27.950]Giving everything (这一次)
[01:31.330]I've got this time (毫无保留)
[01:33.960]Come with me (来)
[01:35.930]Dance with me (与我共舞)
[01:37.400]Glide with me (一起越过)
[01:39.060]Glide through the night (每一个夜晚)
[01:42.450]The battle is mine (这是对我的考验)
[02:13.750]Let no more worries (不要再让恐惧)
[02:16.760]Take away your courage (夺走你的勇气)
[02:20.130]You’re ready to soar (你早该展翅高飞)
[02:24.040][01:45.06][00:40.40]Let me be unafraid ([01:45.06][00:40.40]让我无所畏惧)
[02:27.260][01:48.13][00:43.42]Let me stand up straight ([01:48.13][00:43.42]让我挺起胸膛)
[02:30.350][01:51.50][00:46.52]With the wind with the storm I go ([01:51.50][00:46.52]追随狂风暴雨前行)
[02:36.910][01:58.00][00:53.33]I will find my way ([01:58.00][00:53.33]我会找到属于自己的路)
[02:40.170][02:01.37][00:56.38]To release and truly breathe ([02:01.37][00:56.38]释放能量 真正地呼吸)
[02:43.280][02:04.28][00:59.52]Push away the boundaries ([02:04.28][00:59.52]突破所有界限)
[02:46.590][02:07.60][01:02.77]Down the road down the streams I flow ([02:07.60][01:02.77]沿着山川河流)
[03:00.090][02:33.58][01:54.49][00:49.70]Fly up high to the open sky ([02:33.58][01:54.49][00:49.70]直冲云霄)
[03:09.870][03:02.86][02:49.88][02:10.97][01:06.18]To be free and unafraid ([03:02.86][02:49.88][02:10.97][01:06.18]自由与勇敢)
[03:29.650][03:22.09][01:12.57]Be free and unafraid ([03:22.09][01:12.57]自由与勇敢)